 "info.t1h": "1. Membership",
 "info.t1": "Memberships are personal and non-transferable. Members must show a valid digital card or QR on entry. Prices include 5% VAT.",
 "info.t2h": "2. Payments & refunds",
 "info.t2": "Online payments are processed securely. Unused memberships can be refunded within 7 days. \"Pay at the gym\" reservations are held for 7 days.",
 "info.t3h": "3. Freezing",
 "info.t3": "Freeze days depend on your plan. Freezes extend your end date by the same number of days.",
 "info.t4h": "4. Rewards",
 "info.t4": "Points have no cash value, expire 18 months after they are earned and may be adjusted for refunds or misuse.",
